  "instructions": "Cumulative Standard/Fast final assessment MCQ: 45 single-answer multiple-choice questions in 90 minutes, taken without notes or AI on the proctored Final day (Standard S43, Fast FT25). It covers all five shared technology courses (Spring Boot, Python, HTML/CSS/JavaScript, React and Containers/CI-CD) and every shared module; it does not cover AWS (A1-A7), Foundation courses or Project 2. Each question has four options and exactly one is right; there is no penalty for a wrong choice. Your score is reported to your assessor as a readiness check against 70 percent; in this beta it does not change your Final grade, which is set by the coding assessments, Project 2 and the other published Final components."
